{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From ink and brush, life springs anew, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In death's embrace, souls remain still.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless cycles, ceaseless rebirth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey as the swordsman Red, gradually unlocking additional forms as you progress. Utilizing the Fox's immortal power, traverse treacherous 'Story Relics,' confront four bosses with unique backgrounds, and escape from the ever-changing realm of ink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surmounting various challenges and obstacles, you will redefine your 'destiny' through the constant cycle of rebirth, wielding your sword with resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/e874e89dc9ff69230e3b7e6ec5103594.poster.avif?t=1766127040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/e874e89dc9ff69230e3b7e6ec5103594.webm?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/e874e89dc9ff69230e3b7e6ec5103594.mp4?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fierce battles with infinite creativity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on thrilling battles and explore diverse combinations to craft your unique combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Swordswoman Red and equip yourself with 9 different forms and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your abilities with over 40 distinctive Ink Gems like Tiger Ink, Venom Ink, Curse Ink, Burning Ink, Kylin Ink, and Dragon Ink. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vast array of over 200 perks, such as the Shadow Kite, Octagram Dart, Lock Charms, Dreadful Bell, Lamp of Seven Stars, and Doom Gauge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/daff52e1b8c2c595e0bf43035a95809b.poster.avif?t=1766127040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/daff52e1b8c2c595e0bf43035a95809b.webm?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/daff52e1b8c2c595e0bf43035a95809b.mp4?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The special NPCs, Trial Valley and &quot;Endless Challenge&quot; room are waiting for you to test your limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/1885695d08e208366782f28e491099c3.poster.avif?t=1766127040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/1885695d08e208366782f28e491099c3.webm?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/1885695d08e208366782f28e491099c3.mp4?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fighting alongside intimate Ink Pets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable Ink Pets will serve as loyal companions, fighting alongside you. Depending on various Ink Gem combination, they can undergo a transformation and evolve into 15 plus distinct forms, applying unique moves to assist in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/2975049c14cb77675ad1bbfccbd32d72.poster.avif?t=1766127040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/2975049c14cb77675ad1bbfccbd32d72.webm?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/2975049c14cb77675ad1bbfccbd32d72.mp4?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploring diverse lives in the Eastern Fantasy world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the verdant Buddhist forests, the frigid enchanted Monkey Kingdom, the gentle yet terrifying waterland to the ancient and reverent ruins of Mausoleum, the four major levels each have a guardian, and their mysterious pasts await your exploration. Wielding a sword, ventured alone through the dim world and overcome formidable foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/c146ecce32b50f19a6ed9c79afbed4a9.poster.avif?t=1766127040\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/c146ecce32b50f19a6ed9c79afbed4a9.webm?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/c146ecce32b50f19a6ed9c79afbed4a9.mp4?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and conquer over 20 creatures with distinctive Chinese characteristics, including Fox Demon, Peony Fariy, and Mirror Sprite. Each of them comes with a unique backstory. By continuously enhancing mutual affection, unlock more intimate dialogues, and deepen the understanding of each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/86ef39d4aecf2bdc087f0a429476ecf8.poster.avif?t=1766127040\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/86ef39d4aecf2bdc087f0a429476ecf8.webm?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/86ef39d4aecf2bdc087f0a429476ecf8.mp4?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Entering the Ink Realm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597080/802eb7877978b9e1512202f824619451dd4af006.jpg"},{"name":"Rewrite Fate!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597080/e82cac6cb8abda20b68968f8a25a53821b194dfe.jpg"},{"name":"Unstoppable Momentum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597080/8a1b9341fd71c5d627c535de75be5147b77393e9.jpg"},{"name":"Chasing Away Beasts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597080/9bdc3a412ec443ed378c5abf0ea411e4125ecb5b.jpg"},{"name":"Blessed by the Spirit Fox","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597080/a8622fa4fa038fe5d0bda60400bfa4c4a05a1133.jpg"},{"name":"Unmatched Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597080/4050ef0d1412eb5768c8cfbdb1735084a1f469da.jpg"},{"name":"Unprecedented Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597080/68d414eaa39c4e8bc275526dde7bc541f4e9f702.jpg"},{"name":"The Loneliness of Invincibility","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597080/7bec5064a8a80a7f86bdc8b28ee66b86a10a7fb3.jpg"},{"name":"Ink Gem? Let Me See","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597080/2e34e0a3012ef6bcbacfd2d0e1f77723c2d261db.jpg"},{"name":"Ink Gem? Hand It Over","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597080/251b2464f48894d329cbb8a27e3860dd788b0986.jpg"}],"total":71},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2597080?t=1766127040","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766127040","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766127040","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766127040","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2710500,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join Our Community</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/849af4f3f941faa7abb7b5f70e202ead.avif?t=1766127040\" width=630 height=216 /></span><br><br>Follow our social media for the latest updates of Realm of Ink.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From ink and brush, life springs anew, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In death's embrace, souls remain still.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless cycles, ceaseless rebirth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey as the swordsman Red, gradually unlocking additional forms as you progress. Utilizing the Fox's immortal power, traverse treacherous 'Story Relics,' confront four bosses with unique backgrounds, and escape from the ever-changing realm of ink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surmounting various challenges and obstacles, you will redefine your 'destiny' through the constant cycle of rebirth, wielding your sword with resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/e874e89dc9ff69230e3b7e6ec5103594.poster.avif?t=1766127040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/e874e89dc9ff69230e3b7e6ec5103594.webm?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/e874e89dc9ff69230e3b7e6ec5103594.mp4?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fierce battles with infinite creativity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on thrilling battles and explore diverse combinations to craft your unique combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Swordswoman Red and equip yourself with 9 different forms and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your abilities with over 40 distinctive Ink Gems like Tiger Ink, Venom Ink, Curse Ink, Burning Ink, Kylin Ink, and Dragon Ink. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vast array of over 200 perks, such as the Shadow Kite, Octagram Dart, Lock Charms, Dreadful Bell, Lamp of Seven Stars, and Doom Gauge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/daff52e1b8c2c595e0bf43035a95809b.poster.avif?t=1766127040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/daff52e1b8c2c595e0bf43035a95809b.webm?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/daff52e1b8c2c595e0bf43035a95809b.mp4?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The special NPCs, Trial Valley and &quot;Endless Challenge&quot; room are waiting for you to test your limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/1885695d08e208366782f28e491099c3.poster.avif?t=1766127040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/1885695d08e208366782f28e491099c3.webm?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/1885695d08e208366782f28e491099c3.mp4?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fighting alongside intimate Ink Pets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable Ink Pets will serve as loyal companions, fighting alongside you. Depending on various Ink Gem combination, they can undergo a transformation and evolve into 15 plus distinct forms, applying unique moves to assist in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/2975049c14cb77675ad1bbfccbd32d72.poster.avif?t=1766127040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/2975049c14cb77675ad1bbfccbd32d72.webm?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/2975049c14cb77675ad1bbfccbd32d72.mp4?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploring diverse lives in the Eastern Fantasy world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the verdant Buddhist forests, the frigid enchanted Monkey Kingdom, the gentle yet terrifying waterland to the ancient and reverent ruins of Mausoleum, the four major levels each have a guardian, and their mysterious pasts await your exploration. Wielding a sword, ventured alone through the dim world and overcome formidable foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/c146ecce32b50f19a6ed9c79afbed4a9.poster.avif?t=1766127040\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/c146ecce32b50f19a6ed9c79afbed4a9.webm?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/c146ecce32b50f19a6ed9c79afbed4a9.mp4?t=1766127040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and conquer over 20 creatures with distinctive Chinese characteristics, including Fox Demon, Peony Fariy, and Mirror Sprite. Each of them comes with a unique backstory. By continuously enhancing mutual affection, unlock more intimate dialogues, and deepen the understanding of each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/86ef39d4aecf2bdc087f0a429476ecf8.poster.avif?t=1766127040\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea